   "title": "Entertainment Empire: Nigerian Entertainers Whose Children Continued Their Legacy",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/entertainment-empire-nigerian-entertainers-whose-children-continued-their-legacy/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
