   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription Confrontations with Chinese troops continue to take place at multiple sites along the border in Arunachal Pradesh, according to Indo-Tibetan Border Police (ITBP) director general Shatrujeet Kapur. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles.",
