   "title": "R. Senthamil Selvan is new chairperson of TNCC’s Scheduled Caste department",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/r-senthamil-selvan-is-new-chairperson-of-tnccs-scheduled-caste-department/article71616858.ece",
