   "title": "TVK functionary booked for alleged sexual harassment of college student",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Madurai/tvk-functionary-booked-for-alleged-sexual-harassment-of-college-student/article71616423.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
