   "_dt": 1792775567.0,
   "ageDays": 0.03,
   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription The Thuckalay police have registered a case against Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam (TVK) functionary for allegedly sexually harassing a college student in Kanniyakumari district. Christopher, a TVK functionary from Marundhukottai, offered them a ride in his car.",
   "summary_zh": "订阅即可解锁这些内容。Thuckalay警方已就一名Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam（TVK）工作人员涉嫌性骚扰一名大学生一案立案，受害者来自Kanniyakumari县。Christopher是来自Marundhukottai的TVK工作人员，他曾驾车载他们一程。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription The Thuckalay police have registered a case against Tamilaga Vettri Kazhagam (TVK) functionary for allegedly sexually harassing a college student in Kanniyakumari district. The police said the survivor, a resident of Kulasekaram, and her friend, a TVK party member from Moolachal, were waiting for a bus in Nagercoil on Wednesday, when L. Christopher, a TVK functionary from Marundhukottai, offered them a ride in his car. After dropping her friend at Moolachal, Christopher allegedly proceeded to drop the survivor in Kulasekaram. The crime was allegedly committed during the journey, the police said. The survivor subsequently lodged a complaint at the Kotticode police station. The complaint was later transferred to the Thuckalay police, who registered a case on Thursday. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
