   "summary": "For millions of Indians, the road to the ultimate career aspiration had a familiar script - an engineering degree to get a tech services job, then a posting in the US, repeated visa renewals and then the green card that gave them permanent residency in the country.",
   "summary_zh": "对数百万印度人来说，通往最终职业梦想的道路遵循着一套熟悉的模式——先取得工程学位，获得科技服务业工作，随后派驻美国，反复续签签证，最终拿到赋予他们在该国永久居留权的绿卡。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "For millions of Indians, the road to the ultimate career aspiration had a familiar script - an engineering degree to get a tech services job, then a posting in the US, repeated visa renewals and then the green card that gave them permanent residency in the country.",
