   "title": "Pentagon, Lockheed announce deal for 850 F-35 jets over 10 years",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/world/20261022/pentagon-lockheed-announce-deal-for-850-f-35-jets-over-10-years",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
