   "_dt": 1792565912.0,
   "ageDays": 2.45,
   "summary": "Layer 1 Reno Omokri has received the agreement of the Government of Mexico for his appointment as Nigeria’s Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary to the country. Omokri disclosed this on his X platform on Wednesday, saying the Chargé d’Affaires of the Embassy of Mexico in Abuja, Mr José Manuel Briseño Flores, delivered the agreement to the Director of Protocol at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Ambassador Babagana Wakil.",
   "summary_zh": "第一线人士雷诺·奥莫克里已获得墨西哥政府同意，任命他为尼日利亚驻该国特命全权大使。奥莫克里周三在其X平台上披露了这一消息，称墨西哥驻阿布贾大使馆临时代办何塞·曼努埃尔·布里塞尼奥·弗洛雷斯先生已将同意书交给外交部礼宾司司长巴巴加纳·瓦基尔大使。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Layer 1 Reno Omokri has received the agreement of the Government of Mexico for his appointment as Nigeria’s Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary to the country. Omokri disclosed this on his X platform on Wednesday, saying the Chargé d’Affaires of the Embassy of Mexico in Abuja, Mr José Manuel Briseño Flores, delivered the agreement to the Director of Protocol at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Ambassador Babagana Wakil. The agreement formally signifies the Mexican government’s acceptance of Omokri’s appointment as Nigeria’s ambassador to Mexico. According to Omokri, his diplomatic assignment will also include concurrent accreditation to Guatemala, Honduras and Nicaragua. He announced the development in a post expressing gratitude to God, describing himself by his full name, Bemigho Reno Omokri, and confirming his designation as Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary of the Federal Republic of Nigeria to the United Mexican States. Comments expressed here do not reflect the opinions of Vanguard newspapers or any employee thereof",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
