   "title": "#ThisWeekinUSNigeriaHistory in 1999, Secretary of State Madeleine K.",
   "url": "https://x.com/USinNigeria/status/2112893144282861956",
   "snippet": "#ThisWeekinUSNigeriaHistory in 1999, Secretary of State Madeleine K. Albright visited Nigeria and met with President Olusegun Obasanjo and other senior Nigerian officials at an important moment in United States-Nigeria relations.\n\nThe visit advanced practical cooperation on trade and investment, education, public health, and regional security. Today, the United States continues to engage Nigeria on shared priorities including expanding commercial opportunities, strengthening security cooperation, protecting religious freedom, and advancing regional peace and stability.\n\nPhoto credit: Gettyimages",
