   "title": "🔴 North Korea arms exports to Russia nearly doubled to $14.4B; new land bridges enable trade split North Korea opened road bridges with Russ",
   "url": "https://x.com/NewsTongueX/status/2112664330470625465",
   "snippet": "🔴 North Korea arms exports to Russia nearly doubled to $14.4B; new land bridges enable trade split\n\nNorth Korea opened road bridges with Russia in September and China last week, operationalizing a new strategy to balance Moscow and Beijing without requiring geopolitical conflict between them.\nNorth Korea-Russia arms trade grew from $7.7 billion in 2023 to $14.4 billion in 2025. The land bridge will strengthen bilateral weapons transfers while North Korean laborers work in Russian drone factories and along the Russia-Ukraine border.",
